# Run out of town and attack the first fallen (monstats 19, fallen1,
# specs/monsters/ai.md §9 table) until it dies. While no fallen exists
# the attack steps stay unresolved on that side (scenario.md §3 rule 5).
scenario 1
name kill-monster
game 1.14d
seed 0x00001234
init 644409375         # game +0x7C (tools/original-hooks.md §2): the DRLG seed
difficulty normal
expansion yes
end 400

char save ScnAma     # the save the original side loads (handoff §3)
char class 0          # amazon
char level 5
char area 0 1
char at default

record s2c rng units stats
snapshot every 25

at 2 msg Run x=@x+30 y=@y
at 40 msg Run x=@x+30 y=@y+10
at 80 msg Run x=@x+30 y=@y+10
at 120 msg LeftSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
at 160 msg LeftSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
at 200 msg LeftSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
at 240 msg LeftSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
at 280 msg LeftSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
